1370/dfas0iwezh/"></a>Разрешение на проведение аэросъемок</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 32%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr36635/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="36635" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr36635"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasrpu608/"></a>Проведение аэросъемок.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 25%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr36636/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="36636" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr36636"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasrfk4fe/"></a>Министерство обороны Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr36637/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="36637" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr36637"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfase0psvn/"></a>115.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr36638/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="36638" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr36638"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasonu8ok/"></a>Разрешение на проведение контрольного просмотра материалов аэросъемки и космической съемки</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 32%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr36639/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="36639" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr36639"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaswmh2gg/"></a>Проведение контрольного просмотра материалов аэросъемки и космической съемки.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 25%;