yle="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37103/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37103" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37103"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasbtgy8k/"></a>57.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37104/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37104" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37104"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasl8afx9/"></a>Лицензия на осуществление деятельности по монтажу, наладке, ремонту и техническому обслуживанию устройств автоматического пожаротушения и пожарной сигнализации</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37105/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37105" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37105"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas69i17e/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37106/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37106" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37106"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasvtx34e/"></a>58.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37107/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37107" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37107"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaslimwtg/"></a>Лицензия на осуществление деятельности по заготовке (закупке), переработке и реализации лома и отходов черных металлов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37108/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37108" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37108"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas61tsgq/"></a>300</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37109/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37109" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37109"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaszhrn7o/"></a>59.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37110/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37110" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37110"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasu5cfzd/"></a>Лицензия на осуществление деятельности по заготовке (закупке), переработке и реализации лома и отходов цветных металлов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37111/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37111" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37111"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasyfqahy/"></a>300</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37112/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37112" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37112"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfase4pvbo/"></a>60.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37113/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37113" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37113"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas4xbrt0/"></a>Лицензия на осуществление деятельности по оптовой и розничной торговле природным газом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37114/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37114" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37114"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfastcobql/"></a>300</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="3" style="width: 100%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37115/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37115" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37115"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasg0zf12/"></a><strong>II. Занятие деятельностью (действиями) без документа разрешительного характера или получение документа разрешительного характера с использованием подложных документов</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 68%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37116/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37116" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37116"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasrayhhs/"></a>Наименование документа разрешительного характера (процедуры)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37117/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37117" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37117"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfassk4yzv/"></a>Размер штрафа</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37118/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37118" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37118"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasu2fzxr/"></a>(в базовых расчетных величинах)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37119/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37119" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37119"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasp6v3dc/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37120/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37120" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37120"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasdo65kd/"></a>Разрешение на перевозку тяжеловесных и крупногабаритных грузов, за исключением радиоактивных отходов низкой и средней активности, автомобильным транспортом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37121/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37121" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37121"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasyz837h/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37122/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37122" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37122"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasgqh1ke/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37123/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37123" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37123"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasrgmf3w/"></a>Свидетельство о допуске автотранспортного средства к перевозке опасных грузов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37124/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37124" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37124"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfastm8n7n/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37125/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37125" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37125"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaschxytz/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37126/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37126" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37126"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasgw1dax/"></a>Разрешение на переоборудование автомототранспортных средств</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37127/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37127" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37127"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasllo15c/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37128/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37128" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37128"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaszk27wd/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37129/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37129" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37129"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasutxmig/"></a>Разрешение на выход подвижного состава на железнодорожные пути общего пользования</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37130/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37130" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37130"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfastoukeg/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37131/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37131" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37131"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas93x3z6/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37132/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37132" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37132"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfashdwk1a/"></a>Согласование проекта на строительство и реконструкцию железнодорожных подъездных путей, а также устройств, предназначенных для погрузки, выгрузки и очистки вагонов и контейнеров</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37133/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37133" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37133"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasev295v/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td cla