e-id="37204" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37204"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas66d6fq/"></a>Согласование изменения внешнего вида здания и сооружения</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37205/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37205" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37205"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaske4d6p/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37206/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37206" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37206"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasz72dq2/"></a>32.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37207/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37207" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37207"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasiz3hhd/"></a>Разрешение на перепрофилирование и реконструкцию объекта</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37208/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37208" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37208"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasrbmzfd/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37209/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37209" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37209"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasq50h1f/"></a>33.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37210/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37210" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37210"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfascqgzl6/"></a>Акт ввода в эксплуатацию завершенных строительством (реконструкцией) зданий и сооружений и разрешение на их эксплуатацию</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37211/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37211" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37211"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas710plb/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37212/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37212" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37212"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfascv79xy/"></a>34.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37213/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37213" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37213"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfassh0hrx/"></a>Заключение государственной экспертизы на предмет противопожарной безопасности и сейсмостойкости объекта</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37214/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37214" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37214"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasyw1x80/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37215/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37215" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37215"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasecsak6/"></a>34<sup>1</sup>.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37216/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37216" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37216"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasb30oxt/"></a>Свидетельство на право осуществления деятельности по проведению экспертизы строительных проектов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37217/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37217" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37217"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfase5marc/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37218/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37218" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37218"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas8xvoox/"></a>35.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37219/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37219" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37219"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas6og375/"></a>Согласование проектов строительства, реконструкции и ремонта автомобильных дорог, дорожных сооружений, железнодорожных переездов, расположенных вдоль автомобильных дорог и улиц станций (заправки, газонаполнения и газозаправки автомобилей) АЗС, АГНКС и АГЗС</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37220/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37220" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37220"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas1xu5ay/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37221/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37221" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37221"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasd1r0o7/"></a>36.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37222/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37222" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37222"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfassotaik/"></a>Согласование проектов энергоснабжения потребительских объектов мощностью свыше 20 киловатт</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37223/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37223" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37223"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfask1n7kd/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37224/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37224" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37224"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas3v89a7/"></a>37.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37225/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37225" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37225"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas2uk8f0/"></a>Разрешение для деятельности по продаже нефтепродуктов (автобензин, авиабензин, экстрабензин, дизельное топливо, авиакеросин, мазут, печное масло, нефтяной битум, а также технические масла и смазочные материалы, за исключением упакованных в тару на заводе)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37226/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37226" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37226"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas45vbp8/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37227/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37227" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37227"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas4vvv9z/"></a>38.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37228/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37228" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37228"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas7clkov/"></a>Заключение о соответствии автозаправочных станций требованиям приема, хранения, учета и распределения нефтепродуктов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37229/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37229" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37229"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfast2sqap/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37230/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37230" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37230"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas4gtga6/"></a>39.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37231/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37231" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37231"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasw8ux6i/"></a>Заключение о соответствии вновь построенного, реконструируемого или технически переоборудованногогазоиспользующего оборудования, газопроводов и оборудования на них, применяемых на предприятиях и технологических нефтегазовых объектах (установках), потребляющих 100 000 куб. метров и более природного газа в год, показателям энергоэффективности и об использовании альтернативных видов топлива</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37232/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37232" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37232"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasfnmoo6/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37233/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37233" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37233"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas3bl6sy/"></a>40.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37234/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37234" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37234"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas7x5qw2/"></a>Разрешение на реорганизацию страховщика (перестраховщика)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37235/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37235" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37235"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaselis5e/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37236/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37236" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37236"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaslx6pv8/"></a>42.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37237/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37237" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37237"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasm01lnd/"></a>Решение о списании с баланса пользователя недр запасов полезных ископаемых, утративших промышленное значение либо не подтвердившихся при последующих геологоразведочных работах или разработке месторождения</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37238/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37238" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37238"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasvfd2gu/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37239/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37239" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37239"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasbqqxxd/"></a>43.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37240/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37240" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37240"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasvq7fpu/"></a>Решение об утверждении запасов полезных ископаемых, предусмотренных в геологических материалах о недрах</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37241/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37241" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37241"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasvyai1p/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37242/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37242" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37242"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas5gak5w/"></a>45.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37243/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37243" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37243"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasb9mngm/"></a>Разрешение на право пользования участками недр</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37244/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37244" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37244"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasgpfxxo/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37245/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37245" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37245"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasq3pmgh/"></a>46.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37246/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37246" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37246"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasqfgphi/"></a>Заключение государственной экспертизы проектно-сметной документации на геологические материалы по недрам</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37247/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37247" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37247"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasu1gi6x/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37248/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37248" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37248"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasb4xx4t/"></a>47.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37249/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37249" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37249"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas6vg552/"></a>Учет работ по геологическому изучению недр, связанных с добычей полезных ископаемых</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37250/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37250" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37250"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas1ey06i/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37251/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37251" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37251"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfash0ba09/"></a>48.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37252/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37252" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37252"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasodxdxi/"></a>Разрешение на деятельность по бурению скважин на подземные воды</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37253/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37253" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37253"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasa023vd/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37254/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37254" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37254"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas1nivwh/"></a>49.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37255/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37255" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37255"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas8te5st/"></a>Горноотводный акт</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37256/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37256" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37256"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas8o4gbe/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37257/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37257" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37257"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas66yg1t/"></a>50.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37258/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37258" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37258"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasdd2l7r/"></a>Согласование специального проекта ликвидации и консервации предприятия по добыче полезных ископаемых или его части</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37259/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37259" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37259"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasdm379z/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37260/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37260" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37260"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaspiicrr/"></a>51.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37261/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37261" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37261"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas4lhsqc/"></a>Согласование плана развития горных работ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37262/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37262" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37262"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaslws72r/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37263/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37263" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37263"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas8i3ify/"></a>52.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37264/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37264" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37264"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaswvhb1g/"></a>Заключение об утверждении и согласовании перевода шахт (рудников) из одной категории в другую, а также актов передачи нефтегазовых скважин в эксплуатацию, ликвидацию и консервацию</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37265/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37265" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37265"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasprvbpx/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37266/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37266" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37266"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas1oob7e/"></a>53.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37267/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37267" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37267"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasgtwdfa/"></a>Разрешение на право ведения горных работ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37268/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37268" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37268"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasut4044/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37269/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37269" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37269"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfastltfdw/"></a>54.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37270/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37270" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37270"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas2ovuy7/"></a>Разрешение на импорт или экспорт озоноразрушающих веществ, а также продукции, содержащей озоноразрушающие вещества</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37271/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37271" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37271"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaszc9ckq/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37272/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37272" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37272"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasszgihs/"></a>55.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37273/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37273" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37273"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas6hf10t/"></a>Разрешение на специальное водопользование или специальное водопотребление</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37274/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37274" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37274"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfask8ixsl/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37275/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37275" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37275"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasg9txgi/"></a>56.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37276/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37276" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37276"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasirrqtk/"></a>Разрешение на охоту на диких животных</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37277/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37277" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37277"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasqpgxb8/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37278/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37278" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37278"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasdmikxy/"></a>57.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37279/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37279" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37279"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasn2sx1z/"></a>Разрешение на изъятие из природной среды редких и находящихся под угрозой исчезновения диких животных, занесенных в Красную книгу Республики Узбекистан</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37280/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37280" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37280"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasmpbt8r/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37281/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37281" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37281"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaskep3sk/"></a>58.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37282/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37282" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37282"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas3177eg/"></a>Разрешение на ввоз и вывоз образцов видов животных и образцов видов растений, входящих в приложения I, II и III Конвенции о международной торговле видами дикой фауны и флоры, находящихся под угрозой исчезновения (СIТЕS)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37283/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37283" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37283"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasbreps2/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37284/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37284" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37284"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas2x4zdg/"></a>59.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37285/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37285" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37285"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasxtrgk6/"></a>Разрешение на ввоз и вывоз диких животных, их частей, а также продуктов жизнедеятельности</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37286/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37286" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37286"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfash57tga/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37287/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37287" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37287"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasextu22/"></a>60.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37288/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37288" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37288"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfascycl6q/"></a>Свидетельство о постановке на учет питомника по содержанию и разведению диких животных, а также зоологических коллекций</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37289/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37289" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37289"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas8d1vdg/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37290/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37290" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37290"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasg6ni4a/"></a>61.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37291/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37291" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37291"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaso0hg4o/"></a>Разрешение на сенокошение и выпас скота на землях запаса вне государственного лесного фонда</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37292/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37292" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37292"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasix99pv/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor=