a-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37298"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaspnfmpc/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37299/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37299" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37299"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas17tvi1/"></a>64.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37300/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37300" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37300"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasyoblmc/"></a>Разрешение на изъятие из природной среды редких и находящихся под угрозой исчезновения видов растений, занесенных в Красную книгу Республики Узбекистан</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37301/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37301" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37301"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfashwwlci/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37302/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37302" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37302"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas9hmrb3/"></a>65.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37303/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37303" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37303"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfassses17/"></a>Разрешение на ввоз и вывоз дикорастущих растений, их частей, в том числе занесенных в Красную книгу Республики Узбекистан</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37304/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37304" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37304"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasdhvkh5/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37305/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37305" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37305"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasbczxw2/"></a>66.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37306/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37306" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37306"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasya21sr/"></a>Разрешение на проведение взрывных работ или работы со взрывчатыми веществами</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37307/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37307" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37307"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfass5rm6y/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37308/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37308" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37308"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasz1tgd2/"></a>67.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37309/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37309" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37309"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasuoy7m9/"></a>Разрешение на производство простейших гранулированных и водосодержащих взрывчатых веществ в пунктах, расположенных на предприятиях, ведущих взрывные работы</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37310/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37310" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37310"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas0cxo9i/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37311/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37311" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37311"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasr9xw9f/"></a>68.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37312/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37312" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37312"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas2uq9d5/"></a>Разрешение на применение ввозимых взрывчатых материалов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37313/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37313" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37313"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaszkgyf2/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37314/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37314" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37314"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas061obi/"></a>69.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37315/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37315" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37315"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasee3i8g/"></a>Свидетельство на приобретение взрывчатых материалов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37316/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37316" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37316"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasbugul6/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37317/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37317" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37317"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaskfoskz/"></a>70.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37318/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37318" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37318"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasgv8sbs/"></a>Разрешение на монтаж, ремонт и ввод в эксплуатацию новых взрывоопасных технологических процессов и оборудования, парковых аттракционов, а также использование технических устройств, применяемых на опасных производственных объектах</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37319/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37319" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37319"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas9b04qn/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37320/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37320" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37320"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasiwxrfx/"></a>71.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37321/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37321" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37321"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasw14qem/"></a>Разрешение на выполнение наладочных работ электроустановок на объектах, подконтрольных Государственному комитету по промышленной безопасности</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37322/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37322" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37322"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasg5t2it/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37323/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37323" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37323"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaswpdf1v/"></a>72.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37324/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37324" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37324"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasmpf7iv/"></a>Решение о возможности использования радиоэлектронных средств и высокочастотных устройств на территории Республики Узбекистан</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37325/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37325" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37325"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasoyno4s/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37326/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37326" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37326"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasqp9c44/"></a>73.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37327/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37327" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37327"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas959n7x/"></a>Решение о выделении полос (номиналов) радиочастот для разрабатываемых (создаваемых), модернизируемых, производимых и ввозимых из зарубежа (закупаемых зарубежом) радиоэлектронных средств и высокочастотных устройств</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37328/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37328" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37328"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaska7fu7/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37329/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37329" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37329"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasu3s9t3/"></a>74.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37330/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37330" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37330"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas66bnlk/"></a>Разрешение на приобретение (передачу) и (или) установку (строительство) радиоэлектронных средств и высокочастотных устройств</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37331/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37331" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37331"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaslqkp3l/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37332/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37332" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37332"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasbcblw5/"></a>75.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37333/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37333" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37333"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasmoyyo7/"></a>Разрешение на ввоз на территорию Республики Узбекистан радиоэлектронных средств и высокочастотных устройств</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37334/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37334" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37334"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasynrmpx/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37335/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37335" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37335"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasf3oh6g/"></a>76.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37336/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37336" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37336"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasl6cmrr/"></a>Разрешение на эксплуатацию радиоэлектронных средств</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37337/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37337" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37337"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaskg3pni/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37338/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37338" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37338"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas7gtel7/"></a>77.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37339/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37339" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37339"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas0vfcrn/"></a>Разрешение на право распространения телерадиопродукции зарубежных средств массовой информации на территории Республики Узбекистан</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><