role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37345" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37345"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasy6zv44/"></a>Разрешение на проведение работ по химической защите оборудования, трубопроводов, цистерн и других емкостей</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37346/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37346" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37346"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasvf1g0t/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37347/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37347" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37347"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfastm0lk3/"></a>80.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37348/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37348" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37348"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas26rpiw/"></a>Регистрационное удостоверение лекарственного средства, изделий медицинского назначения и медицинской техники</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37349/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37349" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37349"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasrdpmip/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37350/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37350" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37350"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaszuqdxv/"></a>81.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37351/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37351" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37351"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas96d2xi/"></a>Разрешение на проведение исследований, изысканий на объектах культурного наследия и производство научно-консервационных и реставрационных работ на объектах культурного наследия</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37352/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37352" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37352"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas0pisyq/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37353/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37353" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37353"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasqlpr8y/"></a>82.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37354/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37354" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37354"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfassl6dde/"></a>Согласование представления культурных ценностей на публичные торги (аукционы)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37355/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37355" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37355"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasbxg4h0/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37356/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37356" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37356"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasa1ct3y/"></a>83.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37357/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37357" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37357"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasn2imkh/"></a>Разрешение на приобретение, реализацию, хранение, ношение, перевозку, коллекционирование, экспонирование, ввоз на территорию Республики Узбекистан и вывоз из территории Республики Узбекистан, транзит через территорию Республики Узбекистан гражданского и служебного оружия и боевых припасов к нему</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37358/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37358" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37358"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasfd9usm/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37359/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37359" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37359"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaszsh6mm/"></a>84.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37360/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37360" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37360"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasvwzu27/"></a>Разрешение на ввоз, приобретение и хранение взрывчатых материалов, а также их перевозку автомобильным и железнодорожным транспортом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37361/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37361" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37361"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasye2nv3/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37362/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37362" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37362"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfash5ugm1/"></a>85.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37363/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37363" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37363"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasf8aht8/"></a>Заключение о соответствии объектов (помещений) техническим требованиям к хранению наркотических средств, психотропных веществ, их аналогов и прекурсоров</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37364/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37364" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37364"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasxrwubz/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37365/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37365" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37365"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasowm9f7/"></a>86.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37366/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37366" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37366"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasq7wlnk/"></a>Разрешение на перевозку взрывчатых материалов воздушными судами гражданской авиации</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37367/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37367" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37367"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasqg2kz7/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37368/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37368" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37368"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasa71l0e/"></a>87.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37369/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37369" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37369"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasudnhf8/"></a>Разрешение на транзит наркотических средств, психотропных веществ, их аналогов и прекурсоров через территорию Республики Узбекистан</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37370/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37370" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37370"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas3h06qz/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37371/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37371" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37371"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas0kqe8x/"></a>88.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37372/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37372" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37372"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasm54n91/"></a>Сертификат на ввоз, вывоз из Республики Узбекистан наркотических средств, психотропных веществ и прекурсоров</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37373/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37373" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37373"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasq92que/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37374/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37374" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37374"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasataqz8/"></a>91.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37375/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37375" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37375"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfastwhk2l/"></a>Разрешение на временный вывоз государственных архивных документов или копий, а также архивных документов или их копий, входящих в негосударственную часть Национального архивного фонда, за пределы Республики Узбекистан</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37376/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37376" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37376"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasi64cpl/"></a>150</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37377/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37377" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37377"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaszvfpzb/"></a>92.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37378/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37378" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37378"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasno97wv/"></a>Разрешение на проведение массовых мероприятий</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37379/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37379" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37379"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasxsplo0/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37380/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37380" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37380"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas2swhe9/"></a>93.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37381/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37381" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37381"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas7cg1tb/"></a>Разрешение на экспериментальное применение средств защиты растений</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37382/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37382" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37382"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfash9r8yb/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37383/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37383" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37383"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas36r3ls/"></a>94.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37384/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37384" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37384"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas5ic66h/"></a>Разрешение на использование для хозяйственных целей объектов и сооружений, расположенных в санитарно-защитной зоне, в случае изменения их профиля</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37385/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37385" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37385"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas797uxb/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37386/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37386" data-dwh-source-ty