 class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37440/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37440" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37440"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasg8yg9u/"></a>115.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37441/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37441" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37441"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaskuw5at/"></a>Заключение о создании на объекте благоприятных условий для лиц с инвалидностью в соответствии с требованиями, установленными в градостроительных нормах и правилах</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37442/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37442" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37442"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfase8g2oq/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37443/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37443" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37443"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas4nd1ab/"></a>116.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37444/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37444" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37444"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas4980os/"></a>Разрешение на осуществление строительных и ремонтных работ на дорожном объекте</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37445/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37445" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37445"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas46ou87/"></a>200</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37446/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37446" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37446"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas8zuvty/"></a>117.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37447/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37447" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37447"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasxvkv0g/"></a>Разрешение на эксплуатацию дорожного объекта, строительство которого завершено</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37448/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37448" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37448"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasl10tzh/"></a>100</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="3" style="width: 100%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37449/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37449" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37449"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasqp9xpt/"></a><strong>III. Занятие деятельностью без уведомления уполномоченного органа, а также предоставление уполномоченному органу ложной либо недостоверной информации о выполнении требований и условий осуществления деятельности в уведомительном порядке</strong></p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 68%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37450/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37450" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37450"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas3ixvg3/"></a>Наименование уведомления</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37451/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37451" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37451"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfascg2xal/"></a>Размер штрафа</p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37452/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37452" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37452"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas8ha6tl/"></a>(в базовых расчетных величинах)</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37453/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37453" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37453"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasdkd3df/"></a>1.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37454/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37454" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37454"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas92qf7a/"></a>Уведомление о начале или прекращении деятельности по изготовлению ювелирных изделий из драгоценных металлов и драгоценных камней, а также других изделий</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37455/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37455" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37455"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasm2b21q/"></a>50</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37456/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37456" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37456"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfast58fxr/"></a>2.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37457/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37457" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37457"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasegrgbr/"></a>Уведомление о начале или прекращении работы с драгоценными металлами и драгоценными камнями</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37458/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37458" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37458"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas31dzal/"></a>25</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37459/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37459" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37459"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas212srk/"></a>3.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37460/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37460" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37460"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasnfozvf/"></a>Уведомление о начале или прекращении деятельности по реализации ювелирных изделий и других изделий из драгоценных металлов и драгоценных камней</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37461/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37461" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37461"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfast7zixg/"></a>50</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37462/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37462" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37462"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas8pccix/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37463/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37463" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37463"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas0xlwzm/"></a>Уведомление о начале или прекращении деятельности инвестиционного консультанта</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37464/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37464" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37464"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas7gmuta/"></a>50</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37465/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37465" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37465"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas31p5tf/"></a>5.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37466/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37466" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37466"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasqltr6n/"></a>Уведомление о начале или прекращении дополнительной образовательной деятельности</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37467/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37467" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37467"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaspoby8c/"></a>50</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37468/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37468" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37468"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfascbhihq/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37469/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37469" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37469"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaskq7mfa/"></a>Уведомление о начале или прекращении деятельности по повышению квалификации и переподготовке кадров</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37470/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37470" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37470"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasi6fcgt/"></a>75</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37471/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37471" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37471"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasr96yko/"></a>9.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37472/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37472" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37472"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasi7g9pq/"></a>Уведомление о начале или прекращении деятельности по монтажу, наладке, ремонту и техническому обслуживанию охранных технических средств и систем</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37473/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37473" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37473"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaso06noq/"></a>50</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37474/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37474" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37474"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfasqt92oc/"></a>10.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37475/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37475" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37475"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfastbygat/"></a>Уведомление о начале или прекращении деятельности, связанной с изменением конструкции автомототранспортного средства и (или) его части</p></td><td class