ных коллекций, включенных в состав Национального музейного фонда</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37524/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37524" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37524"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfash2ihze/"></a>75</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37525/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37525" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37525"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas8rmrkx/"></a>27.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37526/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37526" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37526"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfaslvxxzl/"></a>Уведомление о начале или прекращении негосударственной архивной деятельности</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 31%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37527/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37527" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37527"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas5xgen8/"></a>75</p></td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" style="width: 5.41%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/bssPhr37528/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="37528" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr37528"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/dfas56ig2l/"></a>28.</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" style="width: 63.21%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21370/b